#: scenario:scenario_71649F88_1301_47C2_A44F_B5AAF32CF195
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fd897830789b5b267c64eb7f62ec30bee8ceaa7f02634c9888cb86a9627cd9c
