#: scenario:scenario_4D86017F_B013_4F66_BD12_D22AB6461A83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 880fe0c95bd35f833ba2d7d4ac7470d881705ae4496c3776105782e3afae5e46
